<title>ESTONIA: LEVICOM TO ISSUE 90 MLN IN CPS.</title>
<headline>LEVICOM TO ISSUE 90 MLN IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Levicom, Estonia's cable television company, will on August 5 issue 90 million kroons in commercial papers, Tallinna Pank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The papers mature in half a year and yield 10 percent, the bank's issue department project head Aadi Remmik, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201,</p>
<p>reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
